# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the managed workflows client package, authenticate to IBM Quantum Platform, and verify your setup."
msgstr "Instal paket klien managed workflows, autentikasi ke IBM Quantum Platform, dan verifikasi setup kamu."

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Install"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install {#install}"
msgstr "Instal {#install}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows enabled on your [IBM Quantum&reg; Platform instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Contact your administrator to enable it.\n"
msgstr "Managed workflows diaktifkan di [instance IBM Quantum&reg; Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) kamu. Hubungi administrator kamu untuk mengaktifkannya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An API key and the CRN of your instance. See [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"
msgstr "API key dan CRN dari instance kamu. Lihat [Find your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials#find-credentials).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.10 or later, in an active virtual environment. See [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) for how to set up an environment.\n"
msgstr "Python 3.10 atau lebih baru, di virtual environment yang aktif. Lihat [Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit#local) untuk cara menyiapkan environment.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start with AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"
msgstr "Mulai cepat dengan AI skills {#quick-start-with-ai-skills}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use the AI skills in the [Qiskit Function templates repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) to help you install `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, package your existing local code, and deploy it as a managed workflow.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa memakai AI skills di [repositori template Qiskit Function](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-function-templates) untuk membantu menginstal `qiskit-ibm-catalog`, mengemas kode lokal yang sudah ada, dan men-deploy-nya sebagai managed workflow.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the client package {#install-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Instal paket klien {#install-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the `qiskit-ibm-catalog` package:\n"
msgstr "Instal paket `qiskit-ibm-catalog`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This command also installs `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` as dependencies. You do not need to install `qiskit-serverless` separately. The examples in these guides require `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 or later, which installs `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"
msgstr "Perintah ini juga menginstal `qiskit-serverless`, `qiskit`, dan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` sebagai dependensi. Kamu tidak perlu menginstal `qiskit-serverless` secara terpisah. Contoh di panduan-panduan ini membutuhkan `qiskit-ibm-catalog` 0.22.0 atau lebih baru, yang menginstal `qiskit-serverless` 0.38 dan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` 0.51.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You use two of these packages directly, in different places:\n"
msgstr "Kamu memakai dua dari paket-paket ini secara langsung, di tempat yang berbeda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` is the client that you use on your local computer to upload workflows, run them, and get their results.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-ibm-catalog` adalah klien yang kamu pakai di komputer lokal untuk mengunggah workflow, menjalankannya, dan mengambil hasilnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-serverless` runs inside your workflow code. It provides helpers such as `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, and `save_result()`.\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-serverless` berjalan di dalam kode workflow kamu. Paket ini menyediakan helper seperti `get_arguments()`, `update_status()`, dan `save_result()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update the client package {#update-the-client-package}"
msgstr "Perbarui paket klien {#update-the-client-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because managed workflows is in beta, the client package changes often. To check which version you have, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Karena managed workflows masih dalam beta, paket klien sering berubah. Untuk mengecek versi yang kamu punya, jalankan perintah berikut:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Or, in Python:\n"
msgstr "Or, in Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To update to the latest version, run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Untuk memperbarui ke versi terbaru, jalankan perintah berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the new version of `qiskit-ibm-catalog` requires a newer version of `qiskit-serverless`, this command also updates `qiskit-serverless`.\n"
msgstr "Jika versi baru `qiskit-ibm-catalog` membutuhkan `qiskit-serverless` yang lebih baru, perintah ini juga memperbarui `qiskit-serverless`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authenticate {#authenticate}"
msgstr "Autentikasi {#authenticate}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Protect your API key\">\n"
"Do not include your API key in your workflow code, in scripts, or in notebook files. A running workflow uses the credentials and instance that you used to call `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"danger\" title=\"Lindungi API key kamu\">\n"
"Jangan sertakan API key kamu di kode workflow, di skrip, atau di file notebook. Workflow yang berjalan memakai kredensial dan instance yang kamu pakai untuk memanggil `run()`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The managed workflows client uses the same credentials as `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. If you already saved an account with `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, the client loads your default saved account, and you can skip to [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"
msgstr "Klien managed workflows memakai kredensial yang sama dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Jika kamu sudah menyimpan akun dengan `QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`, klien akan memuat akun tersimpan default kamu, dan kamu bisa langsung lompat ke [Verify your setup](#verify-your-setup).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not saved an account, save your API key and instance CRN one time in a trusted environment:\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu belum menyimpan akun, simpan API key dan CRN instance kamu satu kali di lingkungan tepercaya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This method writes your credentials to the same file as [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). The client uses the `ibm_quantum_platform` channel by default, so you do not need to set `channel`. To save more than one account, set `name`, and pass the same `name` when you create the client.\n"
msgstr "Metode ini menulis kredensial kamu ke file yang sama dengan [`QiskitRuntimeService.save_account()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#save_account). Klien memakai channel `ibm_quantum_platform` secara default, jadi kamu tidak perlu mengatur `channel`. Untuk menyimpan lebih dari satu akun, atur `name`, dan berikan `name` yang sama saat kamu membuat klien.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more options, such as saving several accounts or selecting an instance automatically, see [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). If you work on a public computer or another untrusted environment, do not save your credentials. Instead, follow [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
msgstr "Untuk opsi lainnya, seperti menyimpan beberapa akun atau memilih instance secara otomatis, lihat [Save your login credentials](/guides/save-credentials). Jika kamu bekerja di komputer publik atau lingkungan lain yang tidak tepercaya, jangan simpan kredensial kamu. Sebagai gantinya, ikuti [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify your setup {#verify-your-setup}"
msgstr "Verifikasi setup kamu {#verify-your-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connect to managed workflows with your saved account, and list the workflows that you uploaded:\n"
msgstr "Hubungkan ke managed workflows dengan akun tersimpan kamu, lalu daftar workflow yang sudah kamu unggah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have not uploaded a workflow yet, the output is an empty list (`[]`). If you see an authentication error, the client did not find valid credentials. Check the account that you saved in the [Authenticate](#authenticate) section.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu belum mengunggah workflow, outputnya adalah list kosong (`[]`). Jika kamu melihat error autentikasi, klien tidak menemukan kredensial yang valid. Periksa akun yang kamu simpan di bagian [Authenticate](#authenticate).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) to upload a workflow, run it, and get its result.\n"
"- To start from working code, deploy one of the [Qiskit Function templates](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), or adapt a base template for your own workflow.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- [Deploy your first managed workflow](/guides/deploy-first-managed-workflow) untuk mengunggah workflow, menjalankannya, dan mengambil hasilnya.\n"
"- Untuk memulai dari kode yang sudah jalan, deploy salah satu [template Qiskit Function](/guides/qiskit-function-templates), atau adaptasi base template untuk workflow kamu sendiri.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
